WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.430
By 02100 thrill-seekers may have
established bases independent from the

00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:11.010
earth, probably on Mars. And Musk himself, age 47,

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:20.850
says he wants to die on Mars but not on
impact. And he might. But don't ever

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:25.650
expect mass emigration from the earth. Nowhere in our solar system offers an

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:29.640
environment even as clement as the
Antarctic or the top of Everest.

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:34.829
And here I disagree with Musk and with my late colleague Stephen Hawking. I think

00:00:34.829 --> 00:00:41.329
it's a dangerous delusion to think that
space offers an escape from Earth's problems.

